<p>Matam hai bapa aaj Rasule arabi ka,<br>
Makki Madani Hashmi o Muttalabi ka.</p>

<p>Rote hai wasi Ahmade Muqtar ke gham me,<br>
Sadh chaak garebaan hai har ek Nabi ka.</p>

<p>Farmati hai Zehra ke batao mujhe Haider,<br>
Naqsha hai yeh kya aj Rasule arabi ka.</p>

<p>Hairat hai ke bistar pe woh yu chain se soye,<br>
Aadi ho na duniya me jo raahat talabi ka.</p>

<p>Kehte hai Ali bekaso beyaar hua mai,<br>
Afsoos sadh afsoos chuta saath Nabi ka.</p>

<p>Ab sabr karo Ahmade Muqtar ko Zehra,<br>
Bekaar hai ghul ibne abi ibne abi ka.</p>

<p>Kis tarah Nabi humko bhala chord na jate,<br>
Qaliq se payaam agaya din ko talabi ka.</p>

<p>Kounain ki Shahi hai tere ghar ki ghulami,<br>
'Shoukat' ko na kyu faqr ho aali nasabi ka...</p>